WEBVTT

00:00.709 --> 00:02.544
Southeast!

00:02.627 --> 00:06.256
Your next destination is
to your southeast.

00:06.339 --> 00:07.757
I know.

00:07.841 --> 00:10.427
-I know, so can you please keep quiet?
-Southeast!

00:10.593 --> 00:11.678
Please.

00:11.761 --> 00:13.722
I know that, so please.

00:13.805 --> 00:14.973
Please!

00:17.684 --> 00:19.436
Please.

00:19.519 --> 00:21.521
Will you marry me?

00:21.604 --> 00:24.065
I don't know when I'll die!

00:24.149 --> 00:26.901
So I hope you'll marry me.

00:26.985 --> 00:29.946
Please!

00:30.030 --> 00:33.908
What's wrong with that guy?

02:23.434 --> 02:24.686
Please!

02:24.769 --> 02:26.312
I only have you.

02:26.437 --> 02:28.690
Only you can do it, please.

02:29.399 --> 02:30.608
I see now.

02:31.025 --> 02:32.318
I'll find a way.

02:34.821 --> 02:36.406
Can you please do it?

02:36.489 --> 02:38.283
Can you marry me?

02:38.449 --> 02:39.617
I'm begging you!

02:40.869 --> 02:43.288
What are you doing
in the middle of the road?

02:43.538 --> 02:45.248
You know she's not willing.

02:45.415 --> 02:47.750
Don't disturb the sparrows!

02:48.751 --> 02:49.794
That uniform.

02:50.044 --> 02:52.171
You're from the Final Selection.

02:52.255 --> 02:55.425
There's no one like you in my circle,
so I don't know you!

02:56.634 --> 02:59.345
We have met before! We have!

02:59.429 --> 03:02.015
Maybe you don't remember it so well!

03:11.482 --> 03:13.234
It's settled.

03:13.401 --> 03:15.403
You may go home now.

03:15.570 --> 03:17.614
Yes, thank you very much.

03:19.073 --> 03:21.075
You should've stayed out of this!

03:21.159 --> 03:24.203
She wanted to marry me
because she liked me!

03:26.247 --> 03:27.540
That hurts.

03:27.624 --> 03:30.710
Stop slapping me, it hurts!

03:31.002 --> 03:32.378
Calm down!

03:34.464 --> 03:37.300
Since when did I like you?

03:37.383 --> 03:39.928
I only saw you crouching on the road
looking unwell,

03:40.011 --> 03:41.638
so I came to ask if you were all right!

03:42.805 --> 03:47.560
You talked to me because you were worried,
not because you liked me?

03:47.644 --> 03:50.438
I'm already arranged
with someone else, you know?

03:50.521 --> 03:51.898
So I can't possibly be with you.

03:51.981 --> 03:54.234
I suppose you're all right, aren't you?

03:54.317 --> 03:55.568
Goodbye!

03:56.361 --> 03:57.737
Wait up.

03:57.987 --> 04:00.156
-Wait...
-Give it up.

04:00.240 --> 04:02.242
Why did you have to butt in?

04:02.325 --> 04:04.327
You have nothing to do with this!

04:05.161 --> 04:06.913
What look are you giving me?

04:06.996 --> 04:08.248
Stop that!

04:08.331 --> 04:11.793
Why are you staring at me
like I'm not a human being?

04:13.044 --> 04:15.129
You owe me one!

04:15.213 --> 04:17.799
It's because of you
that I can't get married!

04:22.553 --> 04:24.055
Say something, damn it!

04:24.389 --> 04:25.306
Listen.

04:25.390 --> 04:28.101
I'm about to die in my next task.

04:28.685 --> 04:31.020
I'm extremely weak.

04:31.104 --> 04:32.230
Mark my words.

04:32.313 --> 04:35.400
You have to protect me
until I get married, okay?

04:36.234 --> 04:38.194
My name is Tanjiro Kamado.

04:38.278 --> 04:39.988
Well, I'm sorry!

04:40.071 --> 04:41.906
I'm Zenitsu Agatsuma.

04:41.990 --> 04:44.534
You need to help me, Tanjiro.

04:45.118 --> 04:46.828
Help you with what?

04:47.161 --> 04:49.372
Why did you take up this job, Zenitsu?

04:49.706 --> 04:51.666
And why were you embarrassing yourself?

04:51.749 --> 04:53.126
Watch your mouth!

04:53.459 --> 04:55.920
Some woman swindled money from me

04:56.129 --> 05:00.008
and the old man who got it back
so happened to be a trainer.

05:00.174 --> 05:02.260
Then I went through every day like hell.

05:02.343 --> 05:04.679
It was so bad that I would rather die!

05:04.846 --> 05:08.808
I thought I'd die in the Final Selection,
but luckily I survived.

05:08.891 --> 05:11.019
Now I'm living every day in hell!

05:11.853 --> 05:14.188
I'm scared!

05:14.272 --> 05:16.983
I'll be eaten by demons!

05:17.066 --> 05:20.486
They will suck my gray matter
from my ears!

05:20.653 --> 05:24.032
Please no!

05:24.115 --> 05:27.452
Help me!

05:27.535 --> 05:29.537
What's the matter? Are you okay?

05:47.972 --> 05:48.931
Well?

05:50.308 --> 05:52.685
Now that I'm calm, I feel hungry.

05:53.019 --> 05:55.480
Did you bring anything to eat?

05:56.022 --> 05:57.023
No.

06:00.401 --> 06:02.445
Well, you can have this.

06:03.863 --> 06:06.074
Sure, thank you.

06:11.788 --> 06:13.873
You're not hungry, Tanjiro?

06:14.999 --> 06:16.417
I only have that rice ball.

06:24.425 --> 06:26.427
I'll give you half.

06:27.261 --> 06:29.388
Really? Thank you!

06:45.822 --> 06:49.283
I know that you're really
afraid of demons, Zenitsu,

06:49.617 --> 06:51.577
but you shouldn't disturb the sparrows.

06:52.829 --> 06:53.955
Disturb?

06:54.122 --> 06:55.081
Sparrows?

06:55.164 --> 06:56.415
How did you know?

06:57.959 --> 07:00.837
Because you were so hellbent
on not going on duty,

07:00.920 --> 07:04.799
you would hit on any girl you see
and you snore so loudly.

07:04.966 --> 07:06.050
That's what he said.

07:08.010 --> 07:09.303
Is that so?

07:09.470 --> 07:11.389
You understand birds?

07:12.265 --> 07:13.307
You're joking.

07:13.391 --> 07:14.767
You're making a fool out of me.

07:16.602 --> 07:18.855
Run for it!

07:18.938 --> 07:21.607
Tanjiro, Zenitsu, you have to run now.

07:21.774 --> 07:24.527
Both of you go to the next stop.

07:24.610 --> 07:28.239
Hurry up, Tanjiro and Zenitsu.

07:30.324 --> 07:34.787
What? The crow talked!

07:44.464 --> 07:46.174
Goodness, Tanjiro.

07:46.466 --> 07:48.468
I don't think I can do it.

07:48.634 --> 07:52.597
I don't think I'll be of any help to you
as your companion.

07:53.514 --> 07:56.058
The demonic scent
is getting stronger and stronger.

07:56.601 --> 07:58.102
There must be something up ahead.

08:01.147 --> 08:02.231
What's that?

08:10.781 --> 08:12.033
I can smell blood.

08:12.909 --> 08:14.744
But this scent...

08:15.828 --> 08:17.538
What smell is it, you say?

08:17.997 --> 08:20.416
I've never smelled it before.

08:20.917 --> 08:23.336
Don't mind the smell.
Did you hear that sound?

08:23.628 --> 08:26.797
Besides, we have to work together.

08:27.423 --> 08:28.299
Sound?

08:35.223 --> 08:37.141
There are children.

08:37.475 --> 08:38.601
What's up with them?

08:40.394 --> 08:43.189
What are you doing here?

08:49.278 --> 08:51.072
They're quite terrified.

08:52.532 --> 08:56.661
Okay, I'll show you something
you might like.

08:56.953 --> 08:58.371
Look!

08:59.121 --> 09:01.040
It's a sparrow in a hand.

09:04.126 --> 09:05.836
Isn't it cute?

09:15.513 --> 09:18.266
So tell me, what happened?

09:18.724 --> 09:20.101
Is this your house?

09:20.643 --> 09:22.395
No.

09:22.687 --> 09:24.689
This is...

09:25.481 --> 09:29.277
a haunted house.

09:32.488 --> 09:34.532
They took my brother.

09:35.283 --> 09:36.951
We were on the road one night

09:37.034 --> 09:39.537
and suddenly, there was a monster
I never saw before.

09:40.079 --> 09:43.332
It didn't notice us.
It only took our brother.

09:44.667 --> 09:46.419
They went into that house, right?

09:49.672 --> 09:51.424
So you trailed them all the way here?

09:51.507 --> 09:52.550
That's terrific.

09:52.717 --> 09:53.759
You did great.

09:55.469 --> 09:59.724
We followed our brother's blood trail
because he was injured.

10:00.891 --> 10:02.018
Injured?

10:03.269 --> 10:04.437
It's okay.

10:04.604 --> 10:07.773
We'll take down the bad guys
and save your brother.

10:08.566 --> 10:10.693
Really, you'll do that?

10:12.153 --> 10:13.112
Sure thing.

10:14.196 --> 10:15.364
Tanjiro.

10:16.115 --> 10:18.534
Tell me what sound this is?

10:19.243 --> 10:21.996
The noise is making me uneasy.

10:22.371 --> 10:24.332
Is it a drum?

10:25.416 --> 10:26.542
A noise?

10:27.376 --> 10:28.711
I don't hear anything.

10:56.614 --> 10:57.573
Don't look!

10:59.909 --> 11:01.118
Are you okay?

11:02.995 --> 11:05.581
Are you all right? Pull yourself together!

11:07.041 --> 11:10.002
The wounds are so deep, it's...

11:10.753 --> 11:14.173
I got out...

11:17.301 --> 11:20.096
I had so much trouble
to get out of there...

11:20.554 --> 11:24.850
Now you can see that I'm out.

11:26.310 --> 11:32.024
Am I going to die?

11:48.749 --> 11:50.042
He's dead.

11:51.252 --> 11:54.088
He must have suffered so much.

11:55.923 --> 12:00.678
Tanjiro, isn't that the two kids'...

12:19.488 --> 12:20.781
I couldn't save him.

12:22.741 --> 12:24.910
If we arrived here a little earlier,

12:25.244 --> 12:27.371
we could have saved him.

12:28.956 --> 12:31.750
Is this your...

12:33.586 --> 12:35.087
That's not him.

12:36.088 --> 12:39.467
Our brother wore a persimmon kimono.

12:40.801 --> 12:41.886
I see.

12:42.011 --> 12:43.846
They must have caught a number of people.

12:46.682 --> 12:49.435
I promise that I'll bury you
once I get back.

12:50.436 --> 12:52.521
My apologies.

12:53.772 --> 12:56.567
Well, then. Zenitsu, let's go.

13:01.530 --> 13:04.992
But only you and I can save them.

13:11.415 --> 13:13.959
Okay, I see now.

13:16.504 --> 13:17.421
But why?

13:17.505 --> 13:20.299
Why do you pull a face like a demon?

13:20.382 --> 13:22.843
I'm coming!

13:23.677 --> 13:25.888
I didn't force you to come.

13:26.388 --> 13:29.308
I said I'm coming!

13:33.395 --> 13:35.064
As a precaution,

13:35.231 --> 13:36.649
I'll leave the box here.

13:37.107 --> 13:40.069
It will protect you if anything happens.

13:40.694 --> 13:42.321
Well, we're off now.

14:14.812 --> 14:16.730
Tanjiro.

14:16.855 --> 14:19.149
Hey, Tanjiro.

14:19.358 --> 14:21.193
You'll protect me, right?

14:21.277 --> 14:23.863
You'll protect me, right?

14:25.698 --> 14:26.824
Zenitsu.

14:27.283 --> 14:28.909
I would like to apologize first.

14:29.493 --> 14:32.830
I had my rib and legs broken
in my previous battle

14:33.330 --> 14:35.541
and they haven't completely healed.

14:36.166 --> 14:37.084
So...

14:37.459 --> 14:39.879
What? You have broken bones?

14:39.962 --> 14:41.797
How could you?

14:41.881 --> 14:44.967
How can you protect me
when you have broken bones, Tanjiro?

14:45.050 --> 14:47.303
I'm going to die!

14:47.803 --> 14:49.513
What should I do?

14:49.597 --> 14:50.556
I'm doomed!

14:50.639 --> 14:52.141
I'm toast!

14:53.100 --> 14:55.227
How could you have broken bones?
This is inexcusable!

14:55.311 --> 14:57.563
There's a 99 percent chance of me dying!

14:57.646 --> 15:00.816
-I'm dead!
-Calm down, Zenitsu.

15:00.900 --> 15:02.067
You won't die.

15:02.151 --> 15:04.737
I don't need your consolation!

15:04.820 --> 15:05.738
No.

15:05.821 --> 15:07.781
I know what I'm doing, Zenitsu.

15:08.490 --> 15:09.408
No!

15:10.993 --> 15:12.453
You can't come in.

15:12.620 --> 15:16.749
Sir, that box made a rattling sound.

15:16.832 --> 15:20.085
You shouldn't have left it like that.

15:20.502 --> 15:23.422
It's more precious than my life, you know.

15:33.057 --> 15:34.475
Sorry, my butt just...

15:45.653 --> 15:46.946
The room changed.

15:47.571 --> 15:50.032
Or are we moving?

15:50.616 --> 15:52.159
I have to follow the drum.

15:56.038 --> 15:58.624
Sorry that you got separated
from your brother.

15:59.083 --> 16:01.585
But I promise I'll protect you.

16:02.628 --> 16:06.215
Zenitsu will protect your brother too,
so don't worry.

16:07.132 --> 16:08.092
What's your name?

16:08.842 --> 16:10.010
Teruko.

16:10.594 --> 16:12.096
So it's Teruko.

16:12.596 --> 16:14.056
You have a nice name.

16:28.070 --> 16:29.780
Of all the scents around,

16:30.197 --> 16:32.533
it's this stench
that's filling the whole place.

16:33.117 --> 16:34.785
The demon must have eaten many people.

16:35.536 --> 16:38.539
He's also the master of the house.

16:39.957 --> 16:41.834
I'm toast!

16:41.917 --> 16:44.962
I'm toast! I'm a goner this time!

16:45.045 --> 16:47.464
Tanjiro and I got separated!

16:47.715 --> 16:50.300
Teruko?

16:50.384 --> 16:51.301
No!

16:51.385 --> 16:52.886
You must not shout.

16:52.970 --> 16:56.306
If the bad guys hear you,
we'll be in deep trouble!

16:56.390 --> 16:58.183
Let's get out of here quickly!

16:59.143 --> 17:00.561
Why do we have to go out?

17:00.853 --> 17:02.855
You only want to run for your life.

17:03.897 --> 17:05.774
You keep grumbling that you're toast.

17:05.858 --> 17:07.359
That's embarrassing, don't you think?

17:08.110 --> 17:11.572
To grab onto me who's younger than you,
shouldn't you feel ashamed?

17:11.655 --> 17:15.159
Then what purpose
does the sword on your waist serve?

17:18.287 --> 17:20.414
You're a tough talker.

17:23.083 --> 17:24.209
No, that's not it!

17:24.293 --> 17:26.628
-It's because I'm totally useless.
-Let go of me.

17:26.712 --> 17:29.381
-I'll go get help from the grown-ups.
-Please let go.

17:29.465 --> 17:33.135
You can't just count on little kids
to deal with this situation.

17:38.807 --> 17:40.934
It can't be!

17:41.018 --> 17:42.895
I'm sure this is a vestibule!

17:42.978 --> 17:44.271
Where's the way out?

17:44.354 --> 17:45.522
I'm sure it's this one!

17:45.606 --> 17:46.523
Is it this one?

17:47.107 --> 17:48.233
Is it this one?

17:48.400 --> 17:49.526
Or this one?

18:01.288 --> 18:05.501
It's a monster!

18:17.638 --> 18:18.722
Hey!

18:18.806 --> 18:21.266
Don't look at me like that!
Nobody likes it!

18:32.152 --> 18:33.987
If those things...

18:34.071 --> 18:36.657
If they didn't come to mess with us...

18:38.242 --> 18:40.828
Teruko, stay still and don't shout.

18:41.703 --> 18:44.081
The rooms can move,
so don't go to the hallway.

18:44.248 --> 18:45.290
Now, stand back.

18:45.374 --> 18:47.167
Hide behind the cupboard.

18:53.006 --> 18:55.259
Damn it.

18:55.509 --> 18:57.928
It's those monsters' fault
that I lost my prey.

18:58.512 --> 19:00.764
I caught them myself.

19:01.557 --> 19:02.933
Why?

19:03.016 --> 19:04.393
I don't care who they are,

19:04.476 --> 19:07.521
but they surely are
a bunch of uncouth intruders.

19:07.813 --> 19:09.356
I'm so pissed off.

19:09.648 --> 19:11.608
That is my prey.

19:11.817 --> 19:15.737
I found them in my territory,
so they're my prey.

19:21.493 --> 19:23.078
Those things...

19:23.579 --> 19:25.164
Those things...

19:25.372 --> 19:26.874
Hey, you!

19:27.541 --> 19:31.753
I'm a Mizunoto-ranked Demon Slayer,
Tanjiro Kamado!

19:32.212 --> 19:34.089
I'm here to vanquish you!

19:34.631 --> 19:38.177
That is a child of rare blood
that I've found!

19:42.973 --> 19:43.932
Got you.

19:50.105 --> 19:51.064
Teruko.

19:55.485 --> 19:57.154
The tatami is now a wall.

19:57.738 --> 19:59.198
The room is changing.

19:59.823 --> 20:01.950
It's his Blood Demon Arts.

20:02.367 --> 20:05.245
The entire house and its vicinity
are the demon's territory.

20:06.955 --> 20:07.873
What?

20:07.956 --> 20:09.791
There's a pleasant scent rushing this way.

20:10.375 --> 20:11.460
It's not a demon.

20:14.671 --> 20:17.549
Rushing in like a boar!

20:17.841 --> 20:20.469
Rushing in like a boar!

20:27.976 --> 20:29.436
Who is this guy?

20:29.603 --> 20:31.563
He's wearing a boar's hide.

20:35.817 --> 20:37.653
He's wielding a pair of Nichirin blade.

20:41.114 --> 20:42.991
Hey, monster.

20:43.075 --> 20:47.788
I'm going to make a stepping stone
to a higher rank in the Corps

20:47.871 --> 20:50.207
by cutting you into shreds!

20:50.749 --> 20:52.542
I'm pissed.

20:52.626 --> 20:54.294
I'm so damn pissed.

20:56.463 --> 20:57.798
Here I come,

20:57.965 --> 21:00.926
rushing in like a boar!

22:33.393 --> 22:34.519
Okay, Tanjiro.

22:34.728 --> 22:39.232
The girl you parted me from,
I still think she likes me.

22:39.316 --> 22:40.650
What are you talking about?

22:40.734 --> 22:42.736
She told us loud and clear
that she hated you.

22:42.819 --> 22:43.862
I dispute that.

22:43.945 --> 22:47.199
She may have said that,
but she wanted me to go after her, right?

22:47.282 --> 22:49.367
Come to think of it, when she slapped me,

22:49.451 --> 22:51.078
I thought I felt some love.

22:51.161 --> 22:52.412
As she slapped me on and on,

22:52.496 --> 22:54.456
I could feel her lovely feelings
from each slap.

22:54.539 --> 22:57.209
That's why I think
she absolutely likes me!

22:59.294 --> 23:00.712
Say something!

23:00.879 --> 23:03.215
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:03.298 --> 23:05.258
I heard that Zenitsu is all about girls.

23:05.342 --> 23:08.345
No matter who, he cares a lot about them
and that makes his heart flutter.

23:08.678 --> 23:09.721
I can't help it!

23:09.805 --> 23:12.766
Because girls are cute,
soft, and fragrant.

23:13.475 --> 23:16.520
Whenever I think of girls,
it reminds me of that girl back then.

23:16.603 --> 23:19.981
Once I leave that mansion,
I'm going to see her face to face.

23:20.065 --> 23:24.194
Next, episode 12, "The Boar Bares
Its Fangs, Zenitsu Sleeps."

23:24.277 --> 23:26.947
Don't act like I'm not here, Tanjiro!

23:27.030 --> 23:28.198
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.281 --> 23:29.533
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
